ent_title_status":""},"say:6:1320620005:1":{"text":"この手紙には「怖がりなカーシャのために、偉大なメイジは世界で一番強い機械人形を作った。だからカーシャはもう何も怖がる必要はない」とありますが。","source_cn":"卡列琳娜小姐，这封信上写着，“大魔法师给害怕的小卡莎制...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF49F1B545F04307C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:6::2":{"text":"ゴーランの手紙","source_cn":"铐兰的信纸","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB6B0E959FFFA90E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320620006:0":{"text":"あの『メイジと冒険家』は、お兄さんがあなたのために書いたのですか？","source_cn":"之前那本《魔法师与冒险家》，也是他为你写的书吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC07709171160C3EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320620007:0":{"text":"はい。暗いところが怖くて、泣き虫だった私を慰めるために、兄はよく物語を作ってくれました。兄が偉大なメイジで、私は小さな冒険家、メイジは何でもできて、いつだって冒険家を守ってくれるのです。","source_cn":"是的……我小时候怕黑爱哭，哥哥就爱编写童话故事安慰我，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC34A9679842A85AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1320620008:1":{"text":"私はデューラ様にお仕えするため、十三歳で家を離れ修道院に入りました。一方、兄は家に残り、父の書類仕事を手伝いながらメイジになるための特訓を受けました。","source_cn":"我十三岁时离开家，去修道院侍奉艾雅女神了。哥哥在家中和...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D01284F92C8A629","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_fem