tle":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1320620014:1":{"text":"兄は私に、「偉大なメイジのように君を守ってみせる」と言いました。だから決して振り返らず、荘園まで逃げろ、執事が避難所まで連れて行ってくれると……","source_cn":"他说他会像书中的大魔法师一样保护我，让我不要回头，沿着...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC0C53A4E6F23251","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1320620015:1":{"text":"でも、次の瞬間、突然辺りが寒くなり、暗闇に覆われたのです……","source_cn":"但是，周围突然变冷了，浓重的黑暗淹没了我……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7850FA07110CFA37","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1320620016:1":{"text":"それが最後に見た光景か？","source_cn":"那是你记忆中最后的画面吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0CD2A0C432F423A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1320620017:1":{"text":"いいえ。その後、一瞬だけ意識が戻りました。大きな爆発音、肉が押しつぶされる音と、鋭い痛み……","source_cn":"不，我清醒了一瞬，巨大的爆炸声……肉被碾碎的声音……刺...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B8D0528C183150F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1320620018:1":{"text":"最後に見たのは、目の前に立つ兄の姿でした……","source_cn":"最后，我——我看到了，哥哥站在我面前。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27111D8A37CE1F3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_femal